1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,596
I get up at seven o'clock every morning
我每天早上七点起床

2
00:00:02,662 --> 00:00:04,796
I brush my teeth and wash my face
我刷牙洗脸

3
00:00:05,142 --> 00:00:07,195
After I eat breakfast with my family
等我和家人吃完早餐

4
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:09,396
I go to school and learn many things
我上学学了很多东西

5
00:00:09,983 --> 00:00:10,901
During recess
在休庭期间

6
00:00:10,903 --> 00:00:12,396
I play with my friends
我和我的朋友一起玩

7
00:00:12,471 --> 00:00:13,199
After school
放学后

8
00:00:13,199 --> 00:00:15,076
I go home and do my homework
我回家做作业

9
00:00:15,143 --> 00:00:16,062
In the evening
傍晚时分

10
00:00:16,062 --> 00:00:17,399
I eat dinner with my family
我和家人一起吃晚饭

11
00:00:17,399 --> 00:00:21,042
I start to sleep at nine o'clock to be ready for a new day
我九点开始睡觉为新的一天做好准备

